# Surprising = tell the developer

**Bar:** clean app architecture · performance & correctness · native integration · production patterns · maintainability · backwards compatibility · ruthless type clarity & TS hygiene · predictable styling · composability.

When your choices or existing code conflict with any of these, say so. Prefer fixing code and conventions over adding rules.
